  dir_addresdata_err_duplicate_lib_dep.pcpp - Directive fixture: the library
  dir_addresdata_err_duplicate_lib links: it adds the key "hello", which that
  program adds too. Built on its own it is fine (a dep test: built in each
  consumer cell before it, never tallied).
